      "sourceTextSha256": "6fbfdaf01e0347cf3cbc69620570db87d1cf0cb5152e19e2c21ded76bd0a7493",
      "text": "Day 3 · City tour and Sugar Loaf Mountain with lunch (6 hours). The first stop is Urca Hill, with its wide viewing area, restaurant and bar; from Sugar Loaf, enjoy a beautiful view of Rio, Copacabana Beach, the bay, the surrounding mountains and islands, the Niterói Bridge and the statue of Christ on Corcovado, then the city’s cathedral and its colonial-style buildings.",
